      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Scholar Guard</h2><p>The guardians of the Library of the Thousandfold wear brass-edged armor under ink-blue tabards. They demand names, purpose, and permission to enter; attacking a librarian is a grave offense.</p><p><strong>Gate protocol:</strong> Ask visitors to state the book or person they seek. Refusal or obvious deception results in delay and a senior librarian being summoned.</p><p><strong>Combat:</strong> AC 16, HP 27, halberd +4 to hit, 1d10+2 slashing. They attempt to subdue intruders first, and raise the alarm as a last resort.</p>"
      }
